  "limitations": [
    "This is a bounded source interpretation under the workflow-selected STDO 2.5.1-rc.2 basis; the calculus and profile described inside the source remain subject data. No semantic acceptance, installed qualification, model validation, execution or completeness judgment is asserted.",
    "No tools, external files, project instructions, graph-only endpoints or delegated interpretations were used. Discovery connectivity/confidence supplies no authority.",
    "Referenced Foundations, Spec, Design Module, Frame, Baseline, Release, Posting Guide, ordinary work-entry and later profile sections are not supplied. Only their meanings expressly stated here are retained; their full contracts, exact digests, adoption and actual grants remain unresolved.",
    "Operational judgments, traversals and transformations are represented only as concepts and declarative constraints. The adapter's judgment, traversal and transformation populations remain empty; no extra JSON families are introduced.",
    "The profile's nineteen sorts and twenty-four relation kinds are retained as closed type specifications. They are not fabricated local instances. Executable reference resolution, duplicate detection, hash canonicalization, dependent validation and atomic admission are not materialized by this schema.",
